@startuml 3.6.17 - Apply Hashtag
title Sequence Diagram — 3.6.17 - Apply Hashtag

autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

' === Participants ===
entity "Web dashboard" as webdashboard
boundary "HashtagController" as hashtagcontroller
control "HashtagService" as hashtagservice
entity "WorkspaceRepository" as workspacerepository
entity "WorkspaceMemberRepository" as workspacememberrepos
entity "AgencyRepository" as agencyrepository
entity "HashtagRepository" as hashtagrepository
entity "TaskHashtagRepository" as taskhashtagrepositor
actor "CREATOR" as creator

' === Flow ===
hashtagservice -> hashtagservice: Check active tags, version and required scope
hashtagservice -> hashtagservice: Check CREATOR and destination rights
hashtagservice -> hashtagservice: Merge tags; keep snapshots
hashtagservice -> hashtagservice: Resolve coordinated writeOutcome
creator -> webdashboard: Select hashtags and Apply to Post
webdashboard -> hashtagcontroller: PATCH /api/v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/tasks/{taskId}/hashtags
hashtagcontroller -> hashtagservice: applyHashtags(user, command)
hashtagservice -> workspacerepository: Load workspace
workspacerepository --> hashtagservice: Workspace
hashtagservice -> workspacememberrepos: Load membership
workspacememberrepos --> hashtagservice: WorkspaceMember
hashtagservice -> agencyrepository: Load agency
agencyrepository --> hashtagservice: Agency
hashtagservice -> hashtagrepository: Load selected tags and required scope
hashtagrepository --> hashtagservice: Hashtag

loop invalid session / forbidden / unavailable resource
  hashtagservice --> hashtagcontroller: 401 Unauthorized / 403 Forbidden / 404 Not Found
  hashtagcontroller --> webdashboard: 401 Unauthorized / 403 Forbidden / 404 Not Found
  webdashboard --> creator: Display access or resource error
end


loop invalid selection / stale Post / contract unavailable
  hashtagservice --> hashtagcontroller: 400 Bad Request / 409 Conflict
  hashtagcontroller --> webdashboard: 400 Bad Request / 409 Conflict
  webdashboard --> creator: Display apply rejected; no partial save
end

hashtagservice -> taskhashtagrepositor: Save usage snapshots (proposed)
taskhashtagrepositor --> hashtagservice: snapshotOutcome

alt writeOutcome committed
  hashtagservice --> hashtagcontroller: 200 OK
  hashtagcontroller --> webdashboard: 200 OK
  webdashboard --> creator: Display updated Post hashtag preview
else write failed or version conflict
  hashtagservice --> hashtagcontroller: 409 Conflict / 500 Internal Server Error
  hashtagcontroller --> webdashboard: 409 Conflict / 500 Internal Server Error
  webdashboard --> creator: Display Apply failure; retain previous selection
end

@enduml
